{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.GActionOnSubstrate","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.GActionOnSubstrate","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.GActionOnSubstrate.N_sym_closed_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.GActionOnSubstrate.N_sym_closed_form","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/GActionOnSubstrate.lean#L82-L84","doc":"The closed form, now `rfl` from the definition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.GActionOnSubstrate.N_sym","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.GActionOnSubstrate.N_sym","kind":"def","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/GActionOnSubstrate.lean#L74-L80","doc":"**Symmetric-channel Frobenius trace** `N_sym(q) = tr_F(e_sym^EW · e_H)`,\ncomputed in closed form from Axioms (G-1)–(G-4): composing the two\nidempotent traces in the Frobenius pairing yields the product of their\nq-dimensions (see `g-action-on-substrate.md` for the precise per-host\nexpansion).  Defined as a derived quantity to avoid the redundant\nfield + equality that would inflate the instance burden. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.GActionOnSubstrate.qDimHiggsIdempotent_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.GActionOnSubstrate.qDimHiggsIdempotent_pos","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/GActionOnSubstrate.lean#L67-L67","doc":"The Higgs-idempotent q-dimension is positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.GActionOnSubstrate.qDimHiggsIdempotent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.GActionOnSubstrate.qDimHiggsIdempotent","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/GActionOnSubstrate.lean#L65-L65","doc":"**(G-4) Higgs idempotent.** The categorical q-dimension of the image\n`e_H · A`, the 1-dimensional residual-scalar direction. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.GActionOnSubstrate.higgsVev_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.GActionOnSubstrate.higgsVev_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/GActionOnSubstrate.lean#L62-L62","doc":"`⟨Φ⟩ ≠ 0` (the non-zero vortex morphism asserted by Axiom (G-3)). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.GActionOnSubstrate.higgsVev","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.GActionOnSubstrate.higgsVev","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/GActionOnSubstrate.lean#L60-L60","doc":"**(G-3) Higgs vacuum vortex morphism.** The Higgs vacuum value\n`⟨Φ⟩ ∈ A` — the unique *non-zero* vortex morphism of the\nmass-identity form. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.GActionOnSubstrate.qDimEWSymmetric_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.GActionOnSubstrate.qDimEWSymmetric_pos","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/GActionOnSubstrate.lean#L56-L56","doc":"The EW-symmetric q-dimension is positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.GActionOnSubstrate.qDimEWSymmetric","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.GActionOnSubstrate.qDimEWSymmetric","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/GActionOnSubstrate.lean#L54-L54","doc":"**(G-2) Per-host q-dimension.** The categorical q-dimension carried\nby the EW symmetric channel `e_sym^EW`, fixed by its torus-link\nhosts (e.g. `[4]_q` for the `W^±` host per the audit table). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.GActionOnSubstrate.numIsotypicComponents_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.GActionOnSubstrate.numIsotypicComponents_pos","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/GActionOnSubstrate.lean#L50-L50","doc":"The decomposition is non-trivial (EW and Higgs hosts both present). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.GActionOnSubstrate.numIsotypicComponents","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.GActionOnSubstrate.numIsotypicComponents","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/GActionOnSubstrate.lean#L48-L48","doc":"**(G-1) G-isotypic decomposition.** The number of `G`-isotypic\ncomponents `A^{(X)}` in `A = ⊕_X A^{(X)}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.GActionOnSubstrate.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.GActionOnSubstrate.mk","kind":"ctor","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/GActionOnSubstrate.lean#L25-L25","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.GActionOnSubstrate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.GActionOnSubstrate","kind":"class","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/GActionOnSubstrate.lean#L22-L67","doc":"Categorical $G = \\\\mathrm{SU}(2)_L \\\\times \\\\mathrm{U}(1)_Y$ action on the Frobenius–Hopf substrate\n\nConjectural class — see [`conj:g-action-on-substrate`](../../../quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/g-action-on-substrate.md). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:g-action-on-substrate","label":"conj:g-action-on-substrate","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/g-action-on-substrate.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}